<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<!-- INTENTIONALLY EMPTY (standalone v1): the App Group
     `group.com.haostudio.standalone` (com.apple.security.application-groups)
     is a PAID-team-only capability. With a free certificate (LCSign) the app
     cannot be installed at all while it is present ("无法安装"), even though
     the certificate itself is valid. The widget is not shipped in v1, so no
     code needs the group. Re-add the group here (and in the widget
     entitlements) only with a paid developer account. -->
<dict>
</dict>
</plist>
